#OpenGradient #VerifiableAI #DecentralizedCompute #CleanComputation

The future of AI doesn’t belong to systems we are told to trust, it belongs to systems we can actually verify. We are moving past the era of "black box" intelligence where users have to take a developer’s word for how a model was trained or how their data is being handled.
